{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0062-s002", "text": "I skolan lär hen sig att sätta upp mål och lösa problem både självständigt och tillsammans med andra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0062-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.312103271484375, "generation_seconds": 32.37266798084602, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0062-s003", "text": "Lärandet sker i växelverkan med övriga elever och med omgivningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0062-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.277191162109375, "generation_seconds": 24.051916704978794, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0062-s004", "text": "Läraren styr lärandet, uppmuntrar och ger stärkande respons.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0062-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.334991455078125, "generation_seconds": 25.71669323486276, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0063-s001", "text": "Målet är att elevernas arbete i skolan ska vara undersökande och kreativt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0063-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.2545166015625, "generation_seconds": 24.478544580982998, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0063-s002", "text": "Undervisningsmetoderna kan variera.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0063-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.330718994140625, "generation_seconds": 14.061787469079718, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0063-s003", "text": "Digital kompetens, det vill säga färdigheter i att använda datorer och mobila enheter, blir allt viktigare i dagens samhälle.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0063-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.439483642578125, "generation_seconds": 38.29551384691149, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0063-s004", "text": "Dessa färdigheter är nödvändiga i vardagen och arbetslivet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0063-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.29840087890625, "generation_seconds": 16.77098595397547, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0063-s005", "text": "Därför lär man ut dem också i skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T033327353081+0000-2/hb-c08-u0063-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.324981689453125, "generation_seconds": 13.959585758857429, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
